layout: base.njk
permalink: /demos/keep-ai-on-the-rails/
title: Keep AI on the Rails of Your Design System
---
{#- Keep AI on the Rails (#33). Every rung and the whole diagram are
    server-rendered, so the page reads top to bottom with JavaScript off;
    ed-r-c-rails-stage enhances it into a stepper. Data: _data/rails.js. -#}
<ed-main>
	<ed-layout-container class="ed-r-c-rails-page">
		<ed-page-header>
			<ed-heading slot="heading" enhance variant="headline-lg">
				<h1>Keep AI on the Rails of Your Design System</h1>
			</ed-heading>
			<ed-text-passage>
				<p><a href="https://aianddesign.systems">An AI &amp; Design Systems Online Course Lesson</a></p>
				<p>AI will hallucinate UI and make a huge mess without the proper guardrails in place. Here is a detailed breakdown of how we get AI to (faithfully! consistently! repeatedly!) build UI <em>only</em> using our Eddie Design System.</p>
				<p>This is one of over 150 lessons from AI &amp; Design Systems, an online course by me (Brad Frost), TJ Pitre, and Ian Frost. To watch the in-depth video walkthrough, get installable skills, and join a vibrant community of AI &amp; Design Systems practitioners, <a href="https://aianddesign.systems">join the course!</a></p>
			</ed-text-passage>
		</ed-page-header>

		<ed-section align="left" class="rails-section">
			<ed-heading slot="header" tagName="h2" visuallyHidden>From vibe coding to a design system on rails</ed-heading>

			<ed-r-c-rails-stage>
				<div class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__controls" data-rails-controls hidden>
					<span class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__end">Vibe coding</span>
					<div class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__track">
						<label class="ed-u-visually-hidden" for="rails-range">Step</label>
						<input class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__range" id="rails-range" type="range" min="0" max="{{ rails.lastRung }}" step="1" value="0" data-rails-range>
						<ol class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__ticks" aria-hidden="true">
							{%- for rung in rails.rungs %}
							<li><span class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__tick" data-rails-tick="{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ rung.short }}</span></li>
							{%- endfor %}
						</ol>
					</div>
					<span class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__end">AI + design systems</span>
					<ed-cluster gap="inline" class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__buttons">
						<ed-button data-rails-prev text="Previous" iconName="arrow-left" aria-keyshortcuts="ArrowLeft"></ed-button>
						<ed-button data-rails-next variant="primary" text="Next" iconName="arrow-right" iconPosition="after" aria-keyshortcuts="ArrowRight"></ed-button>
					</ed-cluster>
					<p class="ed-u-visually-hidden" aria-live="polite" data-rails-live></p>
				</div>

				<div class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__map">
					{%- for group in rails.groups %}
					<div class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__group ed-r-c-rails-stage__group--{{ group.id }}" data-rails-group data-rung-in="{{ group.rungIn }}">
						<p class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__group-label">{{ group.label }}</p>
						<ol class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__pieces">
							{%- for piece in group.pieces %}
							<li class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__piece{% if piece.kind %} ed-r-c-rails-stage__piece--{{ piece.kind }}{% endif %}" data-rails-piece="{{ piece.id }}" data-rung-in="{{ piece.rungIn }}"{% if piece.rungOut is defined %} data-rung-out="{{ piece.rungOut }}"{% endif %}>
								{%- if piece.num %}<span class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__num">{{ piece.num }}</span>{% endif -%}
								<span class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__label">{% if piece.kicker %}<span class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__kicker">{{ piece.kicker }}</span>{% endif %}{{ piece.label }}</span>
							</li>
							{%- endfor %}
						</ol>
					</div>
					{%- endfor %}
				</div>

				<ol class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__rungs">
					{%- for rung in rails.rungs %}
					<li class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__rung" id="rung-{{ loop.index0 }}" data-rails-rung data-rails-title="{{ rung.title }}">
						<ed-card class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__beat">
							<p class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__step">Step {{ loop.index0 }} of {{ rails.lastRung }}</p>
							<ed-heading tagName="h3">{{ rung.title }}</ed-heading>
							<dl class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__beats">
								<div><dt>Adds</dt><dd>{{ rung.adds }}</dd></div>
								<div><dt>Now you get</dt><dd>{{ rung.now }}</dd></div>
								{%- if rung.breaks %}
								<div class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__breaks"><dt>Still breaks</dt><dd>{{ rung.breaks }}</dd></div>
								{%- endif %}
							</dl>
						</ed-card>
						<figure class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__output">
							<div class="ed-r-c-rails-stage__capture">Real capture coming: the same prompt, run with exactly this step’s setup.</div>
							<figcaption>“Build me a pricing page,” at step {{ loop.index0 }}</figcaption>
						</figure>
					</li>
					{%- endfor %}
				</ol>
			</ed-r-c-rails-stage>
		</ed-section>
	</ed-layout-container>
</ed-main>
